  "summary": "I’ve always been driven to learn and grow. I started working in high school, first in production for an Italian ice company and then in a busy deli kitchen. Wanting to build a professional career, I joined YearUp, a workforce development program where I strengthened both my soft and hard skills. That opportunity led me to State Street, where I gained 6 years of experience in finance, teamwork, and precision-driven reporting.\n\nOver time, I realized my true passion lies in software and game development. I’ve always loved gaming, building PCs, and tinkering with tech — and I wanted to bring that same energy into my career. I enrolled in TripleTen’s Software Engineering program, where I gained hands-on experience with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and full-stack development.\n\nNow, I’m eager to apply my creativity, problem-solving, and technical skills to design engaging, responsive worlds for players to explore. I’m excited to contribute to new projects, provide innovative solutions, and continue growing as a developer in the gaming industry.\n\nPlease feel free to connect with me here on LinkedIn or via email at ajkovacev@gmail.com. I'm always looking for opportunities to utilize my skills to build and grow our success!",
